From 800bacc340446d7596acd83492ff74d174a3f0f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: uSp8ce <99090718+uSp8ce@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 14:32:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] goodixtls5125: read up to 3 frames per touch, 20-touch
 enrollment, multi-template prints, no heat cutoff

- Verify/identify read up to 3 frames per touch (about 80 ms apart) and stop
  at the first match, so a touch that starts off-centre still matches.
- Enrollment takes 20 touches (the engine holds 32 images per template; the
  old comment saying 12 was the limit was wrong).
- Prints can hold several engine templates (format version 4); matching
  takes the best score over all of them. Version 3 prints still load.
- temp_hot_seconds = -1: libfprint's default model disabled the reader after
  3 minutes of waiting, which broke the lock screen's no-timeout PAM entry.
- GOODIX5125_CAPTURE_DIR / GOODIX5125_BURST for touch capture, plus the
  capture loop and offline evaluation harness under tools/.
